bin/
obj/
out/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# JetBrains Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Test results
TestResults/
coverage/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# Logs
*.log

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Windows
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

**/umbraco/Data
**/umbraco/Logs

# DocFX generated output
public-docs/_site/
public-docs/obj/
public-docs/api/*
!public-docs/api/index.md

# Agent stuff
docs/research

